#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Syluxium App Store: browse, search, install and remove software from
Debian's and the desktop's package repositories (through apt), see and
install updates, and install downloaded .deb packages.

    syluxium-appstore                    the store
    syluxium-appstore --updates          the store, on the Updates page
    syluxium-appstore --search TEXT      the store, searching for TEXT
    syluxium-appstore --deb FILE.deb     the package installer for one file
                                         (what opening a .deb does)
"""
